## Interface: 30300
## Title: Playerbot Control
## Notes: A small, movable control bar for your playerbots: follow or stay, passive or active, attack, crowd control, summon and flee. Orders go through mod-multibot-bridge, so nothing is typed into chat. /pbc opens the options.
